        <mxCell id="note" value="repositories/ layer, and LINE/SMTP notification channels, verified 2026-08-17 (backend/app/repositories/, services/line_client.py, services/smtp_client.py) — real, not in the earlier draft. CLAUDE.md Rule 7 (SAP never touches MySQL directly) and Repository Pattern (Services -> Repositories -> MySQL, never skip a layer) are enforced project rules, not just diagram theory. Auto-Touch's send path (services -> line/smtp) is gated by settings.AUTO_TOUCH_SEND_ENABLED — a config-level kill switch, checked before any dispatch; message generation (services -> Anthropic) is unaffected by this gate and always available. Verified against services/auto_touch_service.py, services/message_generator.py, app/config.py." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="550" width="650" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
